# Committed defaults for `vite build`. A variable already set in the build's
# environment wins over this file.

# The site's public address, without a trailing slash, for the link-preview
# tags in index.html: og:url, og:image and twitter:image. Most link previews
# (Facebook, LinkedIn, X) need them absolute; empty leaves them relative,
# which chat apps such as Slack and Teams resolve against the page. Set it
# when building the edge image:
#   docker build --build-arg VITE_PUBLIC_URL=https://docs.example.edu -f infrastructure/nginx/Dockerfile .
VITE_PUBLIC_URL=
